A linear time-invariant system is described by the state variable model
$$$\left[ {\matrix{
   {{{\mathop x\limits^ \bullet  }_1}}  \cr 
   {{{\mathop x\limits^ \bullet  }_2}}  \cr 

 } } \right] = \left[ {\matrix{
   { - 1} &amp; 0  \cr 
   0 &amp; { - 2}  \cr 

 } } \right]\left[ {\matrix{
   {{x_1}}  \cr 
   {{x_2}}  \cr 

 } } \right] + \left[ {\matrix{
   0  \cr 
   1  \cr 

 } } \right]u.$$$
$$$Y = \left[ {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 2  \cr 

 } } \right]\left[ {\matrix{
   {{x_1}}  \cr 
   {{x_2}}  \cr 

 } } \right]$$$
